        "text": "Pro Wildlife Removal are the experts in wildlife removal in Dunedin, FL. We are fully equipped with industry-standard, top of the line equipment and machinery. Our technicians are wildlife removal and animal trapping experts. We are licensed and certified to service both residential and commercial properties.",
