        "text": "Pine Ridge, FL, with its rich natural surroundings, is home to a diverse range of wildlife. While this biodiversity contributes to the beauty of our community, it also means that residents and businesses frequently encounter wildlife-related issues. Here’s an overview of some common wildlife problems in Pine Ridge and how Pro Wildlife Removal can help:",
