        "_type": "span",
        "text": "We are pleased to offer our services to Saint Petersburg, Florida, as well as the neighborhood and Pinellas County. Our ability to customize our wildlife control tactics to meet the unique requirements of our clients is made possible by our understanding of the local species and their habits. When you hire Petersburg Wildlife Removal, you are selecting a business that is aware of the particular difficulties posed by wildlife in our area.",
